    "name": "opheap beast_credentials example",
    "description": "Functional and security-behavior tests for the beast_credentials REST API (see examples/beast_credentials/README.md). Mirrors tests/api_test.sh; run either standalone (defaults baked into collection variables) or with the companion environment file.",
